{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんわ(*˘︶˘*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/02/10/2768679/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ほっぺたぷくーっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私の地元は一昨日の大雪で昨日は朝から\n家族で雪かきをしました！\n妹は受験勉強のため不参加！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雪が冷たすぎて、顔も足も手もしばれるかとおもったよ～ヽ(；▽；)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雪かきをする前に朝起きて1人で\n外を見に行ったの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そしたらすごく積もっててびっくりした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでね、真っ白な雪の上に足跡をつけたくて外に出ようと思ったんだけど、足跡つけたらもったいないって気持ちもあって悩んでたんだ！(´◦ω◦`)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"結局その時は我慢しました！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"雪解け水が上から落ちてくるから、\n綺麗な雪の上に穴をあけてて\nくやしかったんだ(｡ŏ_ŏ)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、途中からは我慢しないで\nちっぷと一緒に庭を駆け回りました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"足が埋まっちゃってうまく歩けない\nちっぷがとってもかわいかった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっとSな私でも、冷たそうだったからすぐに救出に向かいました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/02/10/2768679/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゅんことらぶらぶ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/02/10/2768679/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きいちゃんにきいちゃおう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/02/10/2768679/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/02/10/2768679/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"選抜発表の収録から少し時間経ってると思うけど、選抜メンバーになって１期生と一緒になることが増えた今の状況に少しは慣れた？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→まだ緊張します！:(´◦ω◦｀):\n先輩方は優しくて気にかけて下さり、話しかけてくれるんですが、まだ緊張しちゃって上手く話せません(´ﾟдﾟ｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/02/10/2768679/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ブログは覗くだけでいいのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→覗いてもらえるだけでも嬉しいですよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/02/10/2768679/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会で覚えられるようにするにはどうすれば良いかな...??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→何か特徴があれば覚えやすいです！服装とか小物とかアクセサリーとかなんでも！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/02/10/2768679/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"質問したいんだけど、特技ガオーって何？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→がおーは手の形をひっかくような形にすること！がおーってゆって威嚇したり噛み付いたりしても大丈夫！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/02/10/2768679/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなかんじ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"撮影:れなち"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/02/10/2768679/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"2期生の中の推しって誰？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→うーん、誰だろう。まいちゅんとみりあとかかな(*˘︶˘*)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/02/10/2768679/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私は高校一年生です！年下の女の子のファンは嬉しいですか？( ˘ω˘ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→とっても嬉しいです♡年上でも年下でも女の子でも男の子でも女の人でも男の人でも犬でも猫でも虎でもパンダでもコアラでも誰でも嬉しい(´･ω･`) 人(´･ω･`)♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/02/10/2768679/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はまだ中2だけど\nきいちゃんって呼んでいい!!??"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→全然いいよー！嬉しい♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/02/10/2768679/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひなたぼっこの条件ってあるの？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→ないですよ！ひなたぼっこしたいな～って思って下さっているのであればいつでも一緒にしましょ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/02/10/2768679/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近、ハンドクリーム買おうと思ってるんだけど、きいちゃんが使ってるの教えて？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→ハンドクリームは普段つかっていません(´ﾟдﾟ｀)持っているんだけど、ハンドクリーム塗らないんだ(；-；)女子力あげるために塗ろう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/02/10/2768679/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"好きな食べ物はなんですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→いろいろいっぱいあるよ！\nうなぎとか大きいぺろぺろキャンディとか！わたあめもすき！おすしもハンバーグも焼肉もすき！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/02/10/2768679/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"がおー！とまりかのがうっち！とどっちが強いのかな？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→まりかさんのがうっち強そうだな～！でも、私のがおーは無敵だから私の方が強いかもしれない！今度戦わせてもらってきます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/02/10/2768679/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近食べて美味しいと思ったものは？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→焼肉のたん！焼肉にいくとたんばっかり食べるの！あとはね、あったかいアップルパイに冷たいバニラアイスクリームを一緒にたべた時おいしかった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日はお父さんにあさりのワイン蒸しを作ってもらって食べたんだ！\nアルコールは抜けるまで蒸すから\n子供の私でも美味しくたべられる♡\nあさり好きなんだ～！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/02/10/2768679/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バレンタインは何か作るーー？♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"→何かつくりたいな～！\n料理得意じゃないけど、メンバーにチョコレートプレゼントしようかな！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/02/10/2768679/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きいちゃんがきいちゃおう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/02/10/2768679/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさんが思う\n日本の中で1番可愛い駅名はどこ？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私はね、\nおもちゃのまち駅だな♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はおしまい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2014/02/10/2768679/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"触覚でひげ丸！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日の乃木どこは\nバレンタイン企画でしたね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハラハラドキドキうわーん。\nってかんじだった(´◦ω◦`)！\n収録中も先輩方の告白したあとが\n可愛くて私までニヤニヤ(´,,･ω･,,`)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来週もバレンタイン企画後半戦\nだからみてね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さあ！私は誰に気持ちを伝えたでしょーか！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それではおやすみなさい(*¯︶¯*)"}],"source":"archive"}